@flexiarg writing-coherence/plain-language-thesis
@title State Top-Level Claims in Plain Language

  + IF: A top-level claim must be understandable by a reader who has not read the rest of the document.

  + HOWEVER: Technical vocabulary compresses meaning, but at thesis position that compression charges readers who lack the prior context.

  + BECAUSE: A standalone thesis is the reader's first entry point and cannot depend on terminology that the document has not yet earned.

  + THEN: State the claim with a concrete subject and familiar terms before introducing any technical sharpening.
